  "type": "feature",
  "system": {
    "attribution": {},
    "description": "<p>Once per scene, throw a net onto a target within a Very Close range. The target must make an Agility or Strength Reaction Roll. On a failure, they must mark a Stress and become <em>Restrained</em>. <em>Restrained</em> lasts until they’re freed with a successful Finesse or Strength roll or by dealing at least 10 damage to the net.</p>",
